# The glade's start piece (#57): a disc of radius 2 where players 1 to 4 begin, open on two
# sides, with the way back west to the basic instance (#140). Format: see Region.parse
# (sim/region.gd); a connector or an exit is a ground tile on the edge and the side it opens to.
origin 4 2
  . . .
 . . . .
. . 1 . .
 . 2 . 3
  . 4 .
connector 2 0 0
exit -2 0 3 basic
connector 0 -2 2
